{"version":3,"term":{"cols":110,"rows":34},"timestamp":1786963537,"idle_time_limit":3.0,"command":"/Users/A92615428/git/GitHub/telekom/k8s-breakglass/e2e/record-breakglass-demo.sh --play","title":"Breakglass user journey: deny, approve, API access, DebugSession","env":{"SHELL":"/bin/zsh"}}
[0.309, "o", "Breakglass user journey\r\nE2E cluster: tenant-a | API: http://localhost:8080\r\nCredentials are held in memory and are not printed.\r\n"]
[2.008, "o", "\r\n1. A protected request is denied before approval\r\nWhat this proves: The authorization webhook fails closed until the requester has an approved session.\r\n"]
[2.008, "o", "$ POST /api/breakglass/webhook/authorize/tenant-a (get configmaps)\r\n"]
[0.095, "o", "HTTP 200\r\n"]
[0.011, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"allowed\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;39mfalse\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"reason\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"Access denied. To request temporary access via Breakglass, visit http://localhost:8080?search=tenant-a and open a new request. Include the reason for access, the target cluster, and the requested group(s). If you need help, contact your platform admins.\"\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "Before state: no approved session -> webhook denied the request.\r\n"]
[2.007, "o", "\r\n2. The requester discovers an available escalation\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "What this proves: The REST API lists only ready escalations matching the requester and target cluster.\r\n"]
[2.010, "o", "$ GET /api/breakglassEscalations?activeOnly=true&cluster=tenant-a\r\n"]
[0.059, "o", "HTTP 200\r\n"]
[0.018, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"total\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;39m1\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"items\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[1;39m[\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"name\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"copilot-demo-20260817104536\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"escalatedGroup\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"complete-flow-test-admins\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"maxValidFor\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"30m\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"approvalTimeout\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"15m\"\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;39m]\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.011, "o", "\r\n3. The requester creates a temporary access request\r\nWhat this proves: The API records the target, requested group, incident reason, and pending state.\r\n"]
[2.007, "o", "$ POST /api/breakglassSessions\r\n"]
[0.066, "o", "HTTP 201\r\n"]
[0.009, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"name\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"tenant-a-complete-flow-test-admins-rlpsf\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"namespace\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"default\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"state\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"Pending\"\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.062, "o", "\r\n4. An authorized approver approves the request\r\nWhat this proves: The requester cannot self-approve; the approver API call transitions the session to Approved.\r\n"]
[2.041, "o", "Expected self-approval denial (HTTP 403): requester cannot approve their own session.\r\n"]
[2.005, "o", "$ POST /api/breakglassSessions/{name}/approve\r\n"]
[0.066, "o", "HTTP 200\r\n"]
[0.009, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"name\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"tenant-a-complete-flow-test-admins-rlpsf\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"state\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"Approved\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"approver\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"complete-flow-approver@example.com\"\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.044, "o", "\r\n5. The same protected request is now allowed\r\nWhat this proves: The webhook recognizes the approved temporary group and allows the Kubernetes request.\r\n"]
[2.008, "o", "$ POST /api/breakglass/webhook/authorize/tenant-a (get configmaps)\r\n"]
[0.122, "o", "HTTP 200\r\n"]
[0.008, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"allowed\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;39mtrue\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"reason\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"Allowed by RBAC (groupCount=1); see http://localhost:8080?search=tenant-a\"\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "After state: the same request is now allowed by the approved session.\r\n"]
[2.006, "o", "\r\n6. Explicit deny policy still overrides an active session\r\nWhat this proves: DenyPolicy precedence remains enforced even when the BreakglassSession is active.\r\n"]
[2.010, "o", "$ POST /api/breakglass/webhook/authorize/tenant-a (get secrets)\r\n"]
[0.102, "o", "HTTP 200\r\n"]
[0.016, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"allowed\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;39mfalse\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"reason\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"Denied by policy breakglass-e2e-deny-secrets-all-test; No breakglass flow available for your user; see http://localhost:8080?search=tenant-a\"\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "Approved session + matching DenyPolicy -> explicit policy denial still wins.\r\n"]
[2.009, "o", "\r\n7. The requester reads the approved session through the REST API\r\nWhat this proves: The session detail API exposes state, requester, granted group, and expiry for auditability.\r\n"]
[2.008, "o", "$ GET /api/breakglassSessions/{name}\r\n"]
[0.028, "o", "HTTP 200\r\n"]
[0.013, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"name\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"tenant-a-complete-flow-test-admins-rlpsf\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"state\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"Approved\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"requestedBy\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"complete-flow-requester@example.com\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"grantedGroup\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"complete-flow-test-admins\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"expiresAt\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"2026-08-17T11:15:56Z\"\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "DebugSession transition: created as Pending, then observed as Active.\r\n"]
[2.010, "o", "\r\n8. A developer discovers debug-session templates\r\nWhat this proves: The template API exposes the permitted debug mode, namespace, and duration constraints.\r\n"]
[2.014, "o", "$ GET /api/debugSessions/templates\r\n"]
[0.069, "o", "HTTP 200\r\n"]
[0.013, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"total\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;39m1\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"templates\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[1;39m[\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"name\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"breakglass-dev-debug-template\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"displayName\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"Development Debug Session\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"requiresApproval\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;39mfalse\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "      \u001b[1;34m\"targetNamespace\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"breakglass-debug\"\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;39m]\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.011, "o", "\r\n9. The developer creates a temporary DebugSession\r\nWhat this proves: The API creates a controlled debug workload request with a bounded duration.\r\n"]
[2.008, "o", "$ POST /api/debugSessions\r\n"]
[0.113, "o", "HTTP 201\r\n"]
[0.014, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"name\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"debug-test-user-breakglass-hub-dkr5py9hbx76\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"state\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"Pending\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"templateRef\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"breakglass-dev-debug-template\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"cluster\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"breakglass-hub\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"targetNamespace\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"breakglass-debug\"\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.093, "o", "\r\n10. The active DebugSession is available through the REST API\r\nWhat this proves: The detail API reports the active state, target cluster, namespace, and expiry.\r\n"]
[2.011, "o", "$ GET /api/debugSessions/{name}\r\nHTTP 200\r\n"]
[0.014, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"name\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"debug-test-user-breakglass-hub-dkr5py9hbx76\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"state\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"Active\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"requestedBy\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"test-user\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"cluster\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"breakglass-hub\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"templateRef\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"breakglass-dev-debug-template\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"targetNamespace\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"breakglass-debug\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"expiresAt\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"2026-08-17T11:06:16Z\"\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.008, "o", "\r\n11. The DebugSession list and termination APIs close the lifecycle\r\nWhat this proves: The API lists the active session, terminates it, and confirms the terminal state without an infrastructure error.\r\n"]
[2.010, "o", "$ GET /api/debugSessions?mine=true\r\n"]
[0.099, "o", "HTTP 200\r\n"]
[0.016, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"total\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;39m20\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"sessions\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[1;39m[\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"name\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"debug-test-user-breakglass-hub-dkr5py9hbx76\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"state\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"Active\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "      \u001b[1;34m\"cluster\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"breakglass-hub\"\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;39m]\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "$ POST /api/debugSessions/{name}/terminate\r\n"]
[0.074, "o", "HTTP 200\r\n"]
[0.059, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"name\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"debug-test-user-breakglass-hub-dkr5py9hbx76\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"state\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"Terminated\"\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "DebugSession transition: Active -> Terminated; pod access is revoked.\r\n"]
[2.008, "o", "\r\nDemo complete. Temporary sessions are cleaned up after recording.\r\n"]
[0.094, "x", "0"]
